Comment: 0,0:23:00.13,0:23:12.64,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:07.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bazaar at Yomogi Nursery today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:09.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please come join us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:23.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be... Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:27.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anyone else besides me with this form?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.70,0:00:29.59,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Obviously it's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.59,0:00:31.95,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Get your hand off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.95,0:00:33.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.77,0:00:37.23,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Ko-ba-!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.52,0:00:42.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.53,0:00:46.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:47.31,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.31,0:00:50.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you taking a nap in the middle of the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.06,0:00:54.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you're sleepy, going home first and then sleeping on the futon would be a better—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:59.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I... I... I'm not napping!!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.46,0:02:34.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.34,0:02:39.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't "what happened" me! You can't tell just by looking at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:40.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:46.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:52.63,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi, you're somewhat muddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.11,0:02:55.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Get a clue!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.58,0:03:00.30,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, just listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.18,0:03:09.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's rather bleak out today, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:11.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:14.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it'll clear up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.26,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That'd be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.22,0:03:21.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.51,0:03:24.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring something that'll sell really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.11,0:03:28.02,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:31.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm not going to bring anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.99,0:03:36.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I've been fed up with pretending to be a\Nstuffed animal around that Nursery for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.74,0:03:41.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe I'll go to that bear's place and eat a ton of baumkuchen...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.35,0:03:53.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's still in the strangest place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.41,0:04:00.69,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,One Mont Blanc!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:01.63,Default,Zuisho,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.25,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Cut it into fours, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:04.30,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Is mine ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:05.22,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,One baumkuchen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:07.62,Default,Zuisho,0000,0000,0000,,The customer who ordered three slices?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.56,Default,Zuisho,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.56,0:04:10.81,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Is mine done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:13.74,Default,Zuisho,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait just a moment. It's coming right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:15.93,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Here are six slices!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.93,0:04:17.75,Default,Zuishuo,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer for the long one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.98,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a sec... two minutes left!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.90,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Doing well, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:25.28,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It actually was Zuisho's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:28.28,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You've become quite important, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.66,0:04:32.23,Default,Zuisho,0000,0000,0000,,Next time, let's increase the\Nvarieties! We can have chocolate, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.23,0:04:33.46,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Not a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:35.01,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it, little by little!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.01,0:04:37.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You guys have really gotten used to this, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.72,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,In the beginning, we were worried about how things would turn out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:42.15,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,but we somehow managed to catch a good wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.27,0:04:45.66,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You no longer get my sarcasm either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:46.39,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:51.93,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, and we've also started a home delivery service!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.96,0:04:56.81,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.72,Default,Watanuki?!,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, from the Bear's Baumkuchen Shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.72,0:05:01.10,Default,Watanuki?!,0000,0000,0000,,I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:02.31,Default,Watanuki?!,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:03.22,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:07.23,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the usual bird guy this time. Are you a new worker?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.23,0:05:08.16,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:12.94,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, so part-time help then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.48,0:05:16.12,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,There was a time when I had three part-time jobs myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.66,0:05:20.36,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,I was abused terribly by a selfish shopkeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.76,Default,Ginsei,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you have to say? Then goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.09,0:05:24.77,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, actually—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:27.72,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,I've also been to this labyrinth like place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:31.14,Default,Watanuki,0000,0000,0000,,It was another really weird location, with a ton of strange rooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.20,0:05:36.14,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Looking at how well you guys fit into your roles now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:40.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I've completely forgotten what you guys even used to look like in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:42.72,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,This body isn't all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:47.49,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Being hairy is kinda, uh... But otherwise, if we're just careful, things will work out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.49,0:05:49.68,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Getting used to something is scary, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:54.41,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Like I feel like I've always been in this form ever since I was born!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.28,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.28,0:06:00.38,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe that happened... It all feels like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.42,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,More like a nightmare for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.98,0:06:07.17,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,It really feels like it's been a long time since then, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:08.99,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:12.93,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,It we look at it logically, we\Nreally had no chance of winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.93,0:06:14.50,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,The enemy was too terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:17.27,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It was almost like a one-sided beatdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.27,0:06:19.69,Default,Zuishuo,0000,0000,0000,,We fell apart pretty fast too, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:23.58,Default,Zuishuo,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I stepped on someone back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.38,Default,Zuishuo,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who it could've been?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.45,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:28.55,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.55,0:06:31.82,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,It was you, Master Genko? I-I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.82,0:06:33.37,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,It's all in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:38.71,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, it's not like we had the time to get angry over every little thing like that back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:44.80,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to hear anything from you now, no matter how much you disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.46,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,And anyway, a law is a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:52.83,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Right now, there's nothing else for us to do but bake baumkuchen
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.83,0:06:55.84,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,and wait for things to come to a close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.31,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:01.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,We were so close then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.98,0:07:03.48,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,We weren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.48,0:07:06.00,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,Now is a time for repentance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:10.65,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,You can't be thinking or saying terrible things like, "Oh, we were so close"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.65,0:07:12.04,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.93,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Next time we step foot in the heavenly world,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:17.70,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,we won't get away with just being turned into a bear and a bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.70,0:07:19.20,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Surely I'll be turned into a teddy bear,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.20,0:07:22.04,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,and this guy won't even be turned into a bird; just bird bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.04,0:07:26.55,Default,Zuishou,0000,0000,0000,,T-That's terrible! You're the only one who gets to be something cute?! No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:30.56,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Well anyway, absolutely do not, on any account, start any trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:31.01,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.28,0:07:33.37,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.49,0:07:38.59,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.59,0:07:40.76,Default,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,That's important merchandise!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:49.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That stingy bear didn't give me\Nmore than one present in the end
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.57,0:07:54.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see now... eating sweet things makes you want to follow up with something salty, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.40,0:07:59.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And then after eating something salty, I'll eat some more of this baumkuchen...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:04.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder where I could get some salty food...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.37,0:08:10.46,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Soy sauce flavored would be nice, but I'm really craving salt...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.91,0:08:17.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... it gives me that unique sensation in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:27.60,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:29.44,Default,Kid2,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I totally missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.44,0:08:31.66,Default,Kid3,0000,0000,0000,,Woah, the ball came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.66,0:08:32.66,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:33.81,Default,Kid2,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:37.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn kids! All of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.00,0:08:40.86,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's so fun about playing with a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:52.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Woah, what the—!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.21,0:08:56.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What exactly is going—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.95,0:08:59.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:01.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not edible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:09.65,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no you don't. This is my dessert. There's no way you're getting this baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:12.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't cut it out, I'll burn you on a stake...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.63,0:09:16.13,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.13,0:09:18.12,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.12,0:09:25.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn you! Even if — I die — I won't — hand this box over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.38,0:09:34.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, water's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Another crappy situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.10,0:09:53.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I'm going to emit\Nsomething other than flames.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.70,0:10:11.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Body's so heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:23.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This just went from bad to worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.19,0:10:34.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If I use that, I'll be dry in one go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.25,0:10:55.67,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dryers are stronger than I thought they would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.02,0:10:59.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.44,0:11:14.63,Default,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.63,0:11:16.40,Default,Lady2,0000,0000,0000,,Really, that vegetable shop-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:22.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:31.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no, I can't. This is to slowly savor later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:37.34,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not a kid who can't... control himself...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.54,0:11:42.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.26,0:11:47.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This delicious smell is—!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.57,0:11:58.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What is that mysterious thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,{bunny. MOKONA!!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:16.97,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to Mokona Land!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.15,0:12:21.40,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,To all of the little ladies and gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.80,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,Don't have so much fun that you end up getting lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:28.06,Default,Mokona,0000,0000,0000,,With that being said, crank up the enjoyment meter to max!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.16,0:12:36.94,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I've gotten lost in some strange place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:40.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right! That delicious smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:51.31,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, everything looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.75,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:12:59.64,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:01.74,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,I apologize!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.07,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.95,0:13:13.78,Default,Dude,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dang it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:19.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I might look like a stuffed animal, but I'm not actually a stuffed animal...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.66,0:13:26.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I need to hurry up and escape or else\Nsomeone might take my box of baumkuchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.45,0:13:45.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.98,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get you whichever one you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.04,0:13:52.36,Default,Daughter,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, get that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:53.36,Default,Father,0000,0000,0000,,All right, here we go..
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.57,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,T-This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.57,0:14:08.73,Default,Daughter,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.73,0:14:11.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hit the Target?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.49,0:14:15.29,Default,Daughter,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.99,0:14:19.62,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,Papa, I want that blue doggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:26.34,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,That one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.01,0:14:30.22,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You mean me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:48.98,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,Almost but not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:51.20,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I missed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.40,0:14:55.58,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is no laughing matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.54,0:14:57.89,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,This time I'll definitely...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.33,0:15:05.21,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh oh... it's on a collision course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.59,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,You missed again!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:11.14,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.14,0:15:15.14,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange...  All right, next time I'll definitely—!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.27,0:15:21.51,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did it just move?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.51,0:15:24.66,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,It didn't move! Papa's just not very good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.66,0:15:29.70,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Dang it... at this rate, I'm just\Ngonna get more and more fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.70,0:15:31.03,Default,Mama,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.03,0:15:33.43,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Here we go... I'll definitely get it this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.43,0:15:36.05,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see how things go this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:40.50,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Gah, a good adult shouldn't get fired up over this! He should just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.58,0:15:44.70,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.96,0:15:47.37,Default,Mama,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.57,0:15:56.41,Default,People,0000,0000,0000,,We'll help out too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.84,0:16:00.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.57,0:16:07.74,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,We just can't seem to hit it, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.74,0:16:10.06,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:16.54,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,Don't let my appearance fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:19.95,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,I was once feared as the legendary\NMs. Bullet of the Hit the Target game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:31.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Who the heck are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.31,0:16:44.93,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,Uh oh, it doesn't count if it doesn't fall over!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.93,0:16:46.81,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.37,0:16:51.03,Default,Everyone,0000,0000,0000,,All right then. Everybody,\Nlet's combine our strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.03,0:16:54.03,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:15.84,Default,Old lady,0000,0000,0000,,That blue one still hasn't fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.24,0:17:18.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,As if I could stand being some kid's plaything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.38,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:31.97,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:38.95,Default,Boothlady,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It's not here. I can't find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.95,0:17:41.32,Default,Papa,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It fell just now, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.32,0:17:44.27,Default,Son,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it definitely did! Everyone saw it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:58.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Man, what a terrible day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.32,0:18:00.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,At least I've come this far—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.28,0:18:08.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And so that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.40,0:18:14.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,And you, your posters got torn down so you've been running around till now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:17.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Because no one came to the bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:20.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it really was such a small scale thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.49,0:18:22.00,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Whether the posters had been torn down or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:25.99,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,it was foolhardy to expect so much\Nfrom a Nursery bazaar to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:29.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If things were going to turn out like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.77,0:18:33.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,perhaps it would've been better if I\Nhad never suggested we do a bazaar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:35.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:39.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's important is going through with your actions once you've decided upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:42.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you face difficulties, you can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.45,0:18:45.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.49,0:18:49.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you get drenched in water or hit by a sniper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.83,0:18:50.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.63,0:18:55.49,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's action that's the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.49,0:18:57.92,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Just because there aren't customers doesn't mean you should get so downhearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:00.70,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:05.79,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.95,0:19:09.02,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.65,0:19:13.26,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.26,0:19:14.81,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:17.59,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Look it! We've sold this much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.59,0:19:19.34,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,The weather fortune dolls sold too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.62,0:19:24.39,Default,Grandma,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to you, Kobato, I managed to find an unimaginable treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.47,0:19:34.85,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you gonna\Nstand there spaced out for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.52,0:19:37.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:40.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,With this many customers, there aren't enough helping hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:46.03,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,So you hurry up and help out too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:50.55,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.53,0:19:53.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:57.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It's because of your hard work that we managed to get so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.26,0:19:59.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! I didn't—!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:19:59.81,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:04.60,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's... having a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.42,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,And it's all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.06,0:20:11.12,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.12,0:20:12.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.62,0:20:15.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for going out of your way to come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:17.59,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're quite welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:19.48,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,I had a lot of fun and got a lot of stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.08,0:20:21.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:26.74,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, I really wanted to get\Nsomething directly from you before I leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:30.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that's right! I made a stand too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what happened to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:36.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,None of them have sold...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:38.93,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.93,0:20:45.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No one would want something like this mysterious sheepenguinchicken thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.25,0:20:47.71,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll buy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.84,0:20:50.39,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:53.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:58.12,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,It has a very individualistic feel to it. That's just like you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.21,Default,Doumoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hm... a bunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,D-Domoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.90,0:21:17.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Today was a wonderful day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Not for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:20.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:24.05,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Really! Did you not listen to my story?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.67,0:21:27.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um... was it really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.94,0:21:29.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't "was it really" me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:34.90,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I managed to protect the most important thing, so I guess things turned out okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.90,0:21:37.54,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Once I get back, I'm gonna devour that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.54,0:21:40.32,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm going to savor the taste and feast on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:41.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.39,0:21:42.51,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:44.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It... what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:48.66,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? It's gone. My baumkuchen is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.66,0:21:51.87,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No way, we're going back to the Nursery to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.87,0:21:55.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're talking about your\Nbaumkuchen? It was sold off very quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.01,0:21:59.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.29,0:22:05.33,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You said so yourself, Ioryogi. "'I'll bring something that'll sell really well."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.33,0:22:07.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That something was the baumkuchen, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:14.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.24,0:22:17.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Today's score is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:20.69,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,80 points for your passion about the bazaar, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.53,0:22:26.75,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Since I'm disappointed, you get a total of minus 300 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:28.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What??
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.57,0:22:34.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How come, Ioryogi? Are you disappointed because of me? If so, I apologize!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.82,0:22:36.72,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something you can fix by apologizing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.72,0:22:42.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll give you one of the cute\Nbunnies I made, so please cheer—
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.17,0:22:43.02,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,As if I need that!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:45.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,T-Then as a bonus, I'll add one more for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.74,0:22:47.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I said I don't need that thing!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:50.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I'll add a cute bear and sheep as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.35,0:22:55.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't tell one from the other! They all look like mystery lifeforms to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:57.94,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's so mean, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.01,0:01:06.81,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(300,0)\pos(340,90)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.81,0:01:14.48,Title Screen,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)\t(\fscy140\fscx120)\move(340,90,340,45)}Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:09.66,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:14.25,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:18.26,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.49,0:01:21.06,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.33,0:01:28.40,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:33.98,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday,\Nyour dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.77,0:01:37.82,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:41.36,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.61,0:01:44.42,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.56,0:01:47.16,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.41,0:01:52.41,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.22,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:58.81,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:01.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.64,0:02:04.31,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.54,0:02:11.19,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.48,0:02:15.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.01,0:02:19.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
