Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.48,0:02:15.20,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.01,0:02:19.85,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}I believe in tomorrow.
